Sistema de diseño oficial de Adelante Desarrollos, basado en el sistema **Losa Flotante**.
Todos los componentes están construidos sobre los tokens del Figma y reflejan el diseño aprobado.

---

## Tokens del sistema

### Colores

<div style={{ display: 'grid', gridTemplateColumns: 'repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr))', gap: 12, margin: '16px 0 32px' }}>
  {[
    { name: 'brand',       hex: '#ADD010', dark: false },
    { name: 'brand-200',   hex: '#88A024', dark: true  },
    { name: 'black',       hex: '#000000', dark: true  },
    { name: 'ds-gray-500', hex: '#5D636C', dark: true  },
    { name: 'ds-gray-400', hex: '#747B86', dark: true  },
    { name: 'ds-gray-300', hex: '#AAAFB6', dark: false },
    { name: 'ds-gray-200', hex: '#D9D9D9', dark: false },
    { name: 'ds-gray-100', hex: '#EBEBEB', dark: false },
    { name: 'ds-bg',       hex: '#F3F3F3', dark: false },
    { name: 'ds-red',      hex: '#C96C6C', dark: true  },
    { name: 'ds-yellow',   hex: '#F0C802', dark: false },
  ].map(c => (
    <div key={c.hex} style={{ borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
      <div style={{ height: 60, background: c.hex }} />
      <div style={{ padding: '8px 10px', background: '#fff' }}>
        <div style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, color: '#111' }}>{c.name}</div>
        <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#747B86', fontFamily: 'monospace' }}>{c.hex}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  ))}
</div>

### Tipografía

| Token | Size | Line Height | Weight |
|-------|------|-------------|--------|
| `body-sm` | 12px | 16px | 400 |
| `body` | 16px | 24px | 400 |
| `sub-sm` | 20px | 24px | 600 |
| `sub` | 24px | 24px | 600 |
| `heading` | 32px | 40px | 700 |

### Bordes & Sombras

| Token | Valor |
|-------|-------|
| `rounded-ds-sm` | 4px |
| `rounded-ds` | 8px |
| `rounded-ds-lg` | 16px |
| `rounded-ds-xl` | 32px |
| `shadow-ds-01` | 0 4px 8px rgba(170,175,182,0.25) |
| `shadow-ds-02` | 0 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.16) |
| `shadow-ds-03` | ds-02 + 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.16) |

---

